			<view isee:template_view="template:2" isee:name="Terminology Guide 3" background="#082A5C" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="110" type="interface">
				<style/>
				<text_box z_index="-3" background="white" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="18pt" appearance="transparent" x="283" y="0" width="500" height="50" isee:locked="true">Navigation &amp; Terminology Guide</text_box>
				<button z_index="13" transparent="true" corner_radius="12" label="" isee:tooltip="" x="9.9323" y="566.546" width="26.1554" height="24.9464">
					<actions>
						<action target="previous_page">navigate</action>
					</actions>
				</button>
				<isee:shape background="white" border_width="0.5" border_style="none" transparent_background="false" corner_radius="15" x="20" y="94" width="1026" height="456" isee:locked="true" kind="rectangle"/>
				<text_box vertical_text_align="center" font_size="16pt" appearance="transparent" x="90" y="180" width="540" height="327">A Box and Whisker Graph is a statistical chart that displays the distribution of a dataset. It highlights the spread, central tendency, and any outliers present in the data. This type of graph is used to visually summarize variability, making it easier to identify patterns, central values, and unusual observations.

It typically includes:

- Box: Represents the interquartile range (IQR) — the middle 50% of the data (from the 25th to the 75th percentile).

- Line inside the box: Shows the median (the middle value).

- Whiskers: Extend from the box to the minimum and maximum values that are not considered outliers.

- Dots or marks outside whiskers: Represent outliers (extreme values).
</text_box>
				<isee:shape z_index="15" border_color="#989898" border_width="0.5" opacity="1" transparent_background="false" x="683.15" y="95" width="14" height="454" kind="vline"/>
				<text_box text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_size="20pt" appearance="transparent" x="20" y="101.5" width="668" height="58">Box and Whisker Graph</text_box>
				<graphics_frame fill="none" x="724.51" y="180.5" width="300" height="300">
					<image width="500" height="500" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/Box and Whisker Graph.png</image>
				</graphics_frame>
				<button z_index="15" transparent="true" corner_radius="12" label="" isee:tooltip="" x="1032.59" y="566.058" width="18.838" height="25.9222">
