			<view isee:template_view="template:15" isee:name="3. Office" background="#082A5C" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="180" type="interface">
				<style/>
				<isee:annotation z_index="31" background="#90A4AE" font_weight="bold" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="1" show_by_default="true" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="132.5">
					<popup hide_when_editing="true" x="540.851" y="94.8547" width="472.724" height="79.2907">
						<text>This is your main workspace. You will return here throughout the demonstration to review how the system responds to different policy choices.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:annotation z_index="30" background="#90A4AE" font_weight="bold" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:flat="false" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="2" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="190">
					<popup hide_when_editing="true" x="543.103" y="137.999" width="466.481" height="99.003">
						<text>The three long-term objectives for this exercise are displayed here:

keeping warming below 2°C, avoiding major economic downturns, and reducing inequality by increasing labour’s share of GDP.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<button z_index="13" transparent="true" corner_radius="15" label="" isee:tooltip="" x="1025.31" y="564.019" width="33.3913" height="30">
					<actions>
						<action target="next_page">navigate</action>
					</actions>
				</button>
				<text_box z_index="32" background="#E8EBF1" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="98" width="512" height="56">The first goal is to maintain a safe environment by keeping the surface temperature anomaly (STA) under 2°C.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="34" background="#CBD3DF" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="226" width="512" height="56">The third goal is to reduce income inequality by increasing the share of GDP going to labor and narrowing the income gap between capital and labor.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="33" background="#DADFE8" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="162" width="512" height="56">
The second goal is to ensure steady economic growth without experiencing major recessions or depressions.</text_box>
				<isee:annotation z_index="29" background="#90A4AE" font_weight="bold" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="3" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="247.5">
					<popup x="543.501" y="189.476" width="465.685" height="92.0029">
						<text>As you explore policies, use these objectives as reference points to interpret changes in the system. 

Click the next page button &gt;</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:shape z_index="28" border_color="#C5DDE9" border_width="thick" x="1035" y="130" width="10" height="115" isee:locked="true" kind="vline"/>
				<graphics_frame fill="none" x="250" y="559.019" width="566" height="40">
					<image width="1653" height="73" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/Progress Bar 2.png</image>
				</graphics_frame>
