				<isee:annotation z_index="18" background="#90A4AE" font_color="#082A5C" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="1" show_by_default="true" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="107.5" isee:locked="true">
					<popup x="543.125" y="78.5209" width="464.614" height="92.3328">
						<text>The carbon tax reduces warming compared to the baseline, but the system still exceeds the 2°C threshold, with temperature rising to about 2.43°C. Climate improvement is noticeable, but not sufficient to meet the long-term target.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:annotation z_index="19" background="#90A4AE" font_color="#082A5C" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="2" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="160" isee:locked="true">
					<popup x="544.13" y="114.327" width="462.603" height="96.347">
						<text>Economic outcomes show short-term recessionary effects relative to the baseline, though long-run growth (after 2100) stabilizes as the energy system adapts. This illustrates the tradeoff between short-term disruption and long-term benefits.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
