				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="155.71" y="48" width="320" height="68" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_1">A $200 carbon tax sharply increases the cost of high-carbon energy, causing many fossil-fuel–dependent firms to become unprofitable.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="523.191" y="48" width="343.636" height="68" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_2">As these firms close, upstream and downstream industries are also affected, leading to widespread business failures across related sectors.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="355" y="190" width="250" height="85" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_3">Layoffs follow as firms cut costs, reducing household income, consumption, and overall demand in the economy.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="25" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="61.6578" y="190" width="255.16" height="85" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_4">The rise in bankruptcies increases financial pressure on lenders and reduces the availability of credit, weakening economic activity.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="109.887" y="385.152" width="264.696" height="87.1338" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_5">Lower consumption, reduced investment, and constrained public budgets contribute to a recession, slowing GDP growth in the short term.</text_box>
				<graphics_frame fill="none" x="250" y="559.019" width="566" height="40">
					<image width="1653" height="73" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/Progress Bar 5.png</image>
