				<text_box z_index="43" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="107.87" width="243.348" height="36.2609" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Set_Carbon_Tax_Tick">Carbon tax starts in 2030 and rises linearly to $200 by 2080.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="42" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="161" width="304.348" height="44" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Set_Nuclear_Tax_Tick">75% subsidy starting now, phased in 2025–2030.
Phased out by 2100 to avoid long-term reliance on government support.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="41" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="221.295" width="296.522" height="35.9549" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Set_Solar_Tax_Tick">25% subsidy, phased in 2025–2035.
Phased out gradually by 2100 to avoid long-term dependency.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="40" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="277.469" width="278.261" height="39.0619" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Set_Wind_Tax_Tick">25% subsidy, phased in 2025–2035.
Phased out gradually by 2100 to prevent induced demand and over-investment.</text_box>
