				<text_box z_index="44" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_width="thin" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="550" y="171.295" width="450" height="57" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity='Interface."2nd_Policy_Idea_Button_2"'>Gradual implementation avoids the disruption caused by sudden policy shifts and gives households and firms time to adapt.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="44" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_width="thin" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="550" y="244" width="450" height="57" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity='Interface."2nd_Policy_Idea_Button_3"'>Select each policy button to activate its settings. When all four policies are set, click the next page button &gt;</text_box>
