				<text_box z_index="14" background="#E8EBF1" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="44" y="297.904" width="311" height="30" isee:locked="true">The surface temperature is projected to reach 3.17°C.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#E8EBF1" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="355" y="297.9" width="355" height="30">The GDP per person will reach $48500 annually.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#E8EBF1" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="710" y="297.9" width="356" height="30">51.26 % of the GDP is expected to be allocated to labor.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#DADFE8" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="44" y="327" width="311" height="30" isee:locked="true">The surface temperature is projected to reach 2.43°C.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#DADFE8" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="355" y="327" width="355" height="30" isee:locked="true">The GDP per person will reach $43500 annually.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#DADFE8" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="710" y="327" width="356" height="30" isee:locked="true">50.48 % of the GDP is expected to be allocated to labor.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#CBD3DF" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="44" y="356.482" width="311" height="30" isee:locked="true">The surface temperature is projected to reach ${Interface.Median_STA[1]@2100}°C.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#CBD3DF" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="355" y="356.48" width="355" height="30" isee:locked="true">The GDP per person will reach $${Interface.Median_GDPpp[1]@2100} annually.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#CBD3DF" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="8" x="710" y="356.48" width="356" height="30" isee:locked="true">${Interface.Median_Labour_Share_of_GDP[1]@2100} % of the GDP is expected to be allocated to labour.</text_box>
