				<isee:shape z_index="15" border_color="#989898" border_width="0.5" transparent_background="false" x="0" y="289.941" width="1066" height="14.4395" kind="hline"/>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#E8EBF1" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="6" border_width="0.2" x="0" y="297.905" width="45" height="30">EMB</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#DADFE8" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="6" border_width="0.2" x="0" y="327" width="45" height="30" isee:locked="true">Run 1</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="14" background="#CBD3DF" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" padding="6" border_width="0.2" x="0" y="356.48" width="45" height="30" isee:locked="true">Run 2</text_box>
				<isee:shape z_index="15" border_color="#989898" border_width="0.5" opacity="1" transparent_background="false" x="39" y="297.804" width="10" height="88.0955" isee:locked="true" kind="vline"/>
				<isee:shape z_index="15" border_color="#989898" border_width="0.5" transparent_background="false" x="0" y="379" width="1066" height="14.4395" isee:locked="true" kind="hline"/>
				<isee:annotation z_index="18" background="#90A4AE" font_color="#082A5C" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="false" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="1" show_by_default="true" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="107.5">
					<popup x="543.125" y="78.5209" width="464.614" height="80.1589">
						<text>Both policy runs improve climate outcomes relative to the baseline, but the 2nd Policy Bundle delivers the strongest impact and brings warming closest to the 2°C threshold.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:annotation z_index="19" background="#90A4AE" font_color="#082A5C" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="false" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="2" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="160">
					<popup x="544.131" y="111.827" width="462.603" height="110.26">
						<text>Economically, the carbon-tax-only run (Run 1) causes short-term recessionary effects, while the policy bundle (Run 2) avoids recessions in the median case and achieves higher GDP per person than the baseline by 2100 and 2150—though rare, severe downturns remain possible.</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:shape border_color="#C5DDE9" border_width="thick" x="1035" y="105" width="10" height="115" kind="vline"/>
				<isee:annotation z_index="20" background="#90A4AE" font_color="#082A5C" border_color="white" border_width="2.5" border_style="none" corner_radius="15" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#455A64" popup_corner_radius="10" popup_background_color="white" highlight_on_open="false" popup_font_color="#082A5C" popup_font_size="14pt" popup_text__padding="2" launcher_label="3" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="false" x="1041" y="212.5">
					<popup x="544.485" y="113.804" width="461.895" height="126.543">
						<text>Neither policy fully achieves the inequality objective. Run 2 shows modest medium-term improvements, but long-term outcomes converge back toward the baseline, indicating that additional measures would be required.

Click the next page button &gt;</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
				<isee:shape z_index="-11" background="#29446B" border_color="white" border_width="0.1" opacity="0.3" transparent_background="false" corner_radius="15" x="535" y="70" width="545" height="180" isee:locked="true" kind="rectangle"/>
			</view>
