				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="154.238" y="50" width="321.95" height="68" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_1">The policy bundle significantly improves the climate outcome, reducing median warming to about 2.16°C by 2100.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="523.191" y="50" width="360.387" height="68" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_2">In the median case, the policy meets the economic objective: no recessions and GDP per person exceeding the Current Path in both 2100 and 2150.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="338.191" y="185.5" width="304" height="91.7857" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_3">The policy mix can also induce excessive demand and investment, stranding assets and creating inflationary pressure that may lead to unemployment and defaults.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="14.191" y="185.5" width="312" height="91.7857" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_4">However, there is an outlier scenario where the transition triggers a deep 10-year depression, showing that economic risks still exist under certain conditions.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="111.191" y="377.5" width="293" height="98.786" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_5">The policy does not achieve the long-term inequality goal. There is some improvement in the medium term (2050–2100), but outcomes converge back to the baseline afterward.</text_box>
				<graphics_frame fill="none" x="250" y="559.019" width="566" height="40">
					<image width="1654" height="74" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/Progress Bar 10.png</image>
				</graphics_frame>
