				<text_box z_index="57" text_align="center" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="14pt" appearance="transparent" x="0" y="70" width="528" height="24" isee:locked="true">Policy Bundle 3</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="53" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="107.87" width="237.348" height="36.2609">Carbon tax starts in 2030 and rises linearly to $200 by 2080.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="54" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="161" width="304.348" height="44" isee:locked="true">75% subsidy starting now, phased in 2025–2030.
Phased out by 2100 to avoid long-term reliance on government support.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="55" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="221.295" width="296.522" height="35.9549" isee:locked="true">25% subsidy, phased in 2025–2035.
Phased out gradually by 2100 to avoid long-term dependency.</text_box>
				<text_box z_index="56" font_style="italic" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="white" font_size="11pt" appearance="transparent" x="170" y="277.469" width="278.261" height="39.0619">25% subsidy, phased in 2025–2035.
Phased out gradually by 2100 to prevent induced demand and over-investment.</text_box>
				<button z_index="72" transparent="true" label="" isee:tooltip="" x="1031.52" y="118.641" width="20" height="16.5">
