					<actions>
						<action isee:reset_after="never" isee:reset_value="0" isee:controller_value="1" isee:entity="Interface.Implement_Policy_Button_3">control_entity</action>
					</actions>
				</button>
				<text_box background="white" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="8" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="548" y="101.61" width="470" height="61.78" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Implement_Policy_Button_3">Click Implement Policy Bundle 3 to apply the taxation adjustments and examine how the system responds.</text_box>
				<text_box background="#E8EBF1" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="12" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="98" width="512" height="56">The first goal is to maintain a safe environment by keeping the surface temperature anomaly (STA) under 2°C.</text_box>
				<text_box background="#CBD3DF" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="12" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="226" width="512" height="56">The third goal is to reduce income inequality by increasing the share of GDP going to labor and narrowing the income gap between capital and labor.</text_box>
				<text_box background="#DADFE8" vertical_text_align="center" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="12" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="0.1" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="8" y="162" width="512" height="56">
The second goal is to ensure steady economic growth without experiencing major recessions or depressions.</text_box>
			</view>
			<view isee:template_view="template:16" isee:name="16. Result Discussion 3rd Policy" background="#082A5C" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="110" type="interface">
				<style/>
				<graphics_frame z_index="15" fill="none" x="608.239" y="495.5" width="50" height="50">
					<image width="188" height="189" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/Result Page Button 6.png</image>
				</graphics_frame>
				<graphics_frame z_index="-4" fill="none" x="11.3043" y="93.3333" width="1035.24" height="460" isee:locked="true">
					<image width="4178" height="1923" size_to_parent="true" isee:transparency="0" isee:fixed_aspect_ratio="true">r../Graphics/FRIDA page 4 transparent-min.png</image>
				</graphics_frame>
				<isee:shape z_index="-3" background="#082A5C" border_width="thin" border_style="none" opacity="0.9" transparent_background="false" x="10.9524" y="91.9048" width="1051.18" height="462.857" isee:locked="true" kind="rectangle"/>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="182.325" y="49.5712" width="270.866" height="68.3088" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_1">Climate outcomes remain the same as in the previous policy run, with median warming around 2.16°C by 2100.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="520.843" y="47.911" width="214.096" height="71.6291" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_2">Economic results also remain broadly unchanged relative to the earlier policy bundle.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="374.937" y="185.5" width="237.254" height="91.7857" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_3">Wages rise after the tax adjustments, but not as fast as overall economic growth, causing the labor share of GDP to decline.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="75.9301" y="185.5" width="226.616" height="91.7857" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_4">Inequality therefore remains difficult to address, with long-term outcomes still falling short of the distributional objective.</text_box>
				<text_box font_color="#082A5C" font_size="14pt" padding="10" border_color="#082A5C" border_width="1.5" border_style="solid" corner_radius="10" x="109.321" y="385" width="252.56" height="90" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_5">However, wages grow faster than profits, slightly improving the balance between income from labor and income from capital.</text_box>
				<stacked_container x="700" y="133" width="350" height="133" isee:locked="true" z_index="17">
					<graph background="#F5F6FA" font_color="black" font_size="12pt" axis_color="#103B80" grid_color="#9BB7E5" isee:graph_area_color="#1B63CC" legend_position="none" isee:transparent="false" isee:hide_border="true" axis_title_font_color="black" axis_title_font_size="10pt" axis_label_font_color="black" axis_label_font_size="8pt" width="350" height="133" isee:locked="true" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity="Interface.Result_Page_Pop_Up_Button_1" comparative="true" type="box" show_grid="true" isee:tick_type="none" include_units_in_legend="false" plot_numbers="false" isee:label_pie_slices="false" isee:show_pie_borders="true" num_x_grid_lines="5" num_y_grid_lines="2" num_x_labels="6" num_y_labels="4" title=" Surface Temperature Anomaly (°C)" isee:fill_intensity="0.3" isee:allow_blowup="true" isee:allow_zero_axis="true" left_axis_title="Degree Celsius" left_axis_multi_scale="false" left_axis_auto_scale="false" left_include_units="true" right_axis_multi_scale="false" right_axis_auto_scale="true" right_include_units="true">
						<plot color="fuchsia" isee:keep_zero_visible="false" pen_width="1" index="0" show_y_axis="true">
							<entity name="Energy_Balance_Model.Surface_Temperature_Anomaly[*]"/>
							<scale min="0" max="6"/>
						</plot>
						<isee:time_points>
							<isee:time_point>2035</isee:time_point>
							<isee:time_point>2050</isee:time_point>
							<isee:time_point>2100</isee:time_point>
							<isee:time_point>2150</isee:time_point>
						</isee:time_points>
					</graph>
