				<text_box z_index="16" font_size="16pt" padding="20" appearance="transparent" x="150" y="120" width="325" height="263.889">Global warming increases climate-related damages such as heat stress, reduced labor productivity, extreme weather disruptions, and additional bankruptcies due to changing environment conditions. These impacts slow economic growth.</text_box>
			</view>
			<view isee:template_view="template:3" isee:name="CLD 1 - END" background="#082A5C" page_width="1066" page_height="600" zoom="180" type="interface">
				<style/>
				<isee:model_view z_index="31" x="485" y="80" width="570" height="470" isee:locked="true" zoom="0.5" center_x="576" center_y="480" locked_view="true" show_animations="true" show_ltm_table="false" include_documentation="true">
					<model name="CLD_Policy_1"/>
					<isee:highlight_list/>
				</isee:model_view>
				<text_box z_index="16" font_size="16pt" padding="10" appearance="transparent" x="35" y="105.218" width="425" height="422.237">The Complete System

You have now explored how growth, investment, employment, inflation, government revenue, and climate interact through reinforcing and balancing feedback loops.

Policies such as carbon taxes and renewable energy subsidies influence key links in the system, shaping how the energy transition unfolds and how economic and climate outcomes evolve over time.

Here is the entire causal loop diagram. It brings together economic activity, financial dynamics, and climate pressures into one connected system, showing how growth and climate are tightly intertwined.</text_box>
				<isee:shape z_index="30" background="#2C4973" border_width="thin" border_style="none" transparent_background="false" x="1016.09" y="561.087" width="46.9565" height="36" block_mouse="true" kind="rectangle"/>
				<button z_index="16" background="#FBF5F0" font_weight="bold" font_color="#082A5C" font_size="8pt" border_color="#F5FFE0" border_width="thin" border_style="none" transparent="false" corner_radius="15" isee:flat="false" isee:highlight_on_hover="true" isee:highlight_color="#D3F0FF" label="Return to Pathway Menu" isee:tooltip="" x="473" y="565" width="120" height="30" isee:conditional_immediately_update_on_user_input="true" isee:conditional_use_active_value="true" isee:conditional_entity='Interface."Regular_-_Causal_Structure_Skip_to_End_Button"'>
